# Readme and Links

## Readme
This folder will be used for open access publications and links to publications on sustainability relevant to the community.

## Links
- Joanne Durgan, Marta Rodríguez-Martínez, Brendan Rouse, Green Labs: a guide to developing sustainable science in your organization (https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/imcb.12624)

- Mr. Thomas Freese, Dr. Renate Kat, Mrs. Suzanne D. Lanooij, et al. A guidebook for sustainability in laboratories. ChemRxiv. 25 April 2024.
DOI: https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2023-g3lmq-v4
